## CodeGraph

In repos with a `.codegraph/` directory, use CodeGraph before grep or reading files. Without the `codegraph_explore` MCP tool, run `codegraph explore "<symbols or question>"` in the shell. No `.codegraph/` means skip it; indexing is my decision.
